# Antigravity Workspace Rules

## General Constraints
- Provide brief, clear explanations for code changes.
- Always prioritize modern, clean UI design principles.

## Tech Stack & Styling
- Core: HTML and Vanilla JavaScript.
- Styling: Vanilla CSS. Avoid utility classes like Tailwind unless explicitly requested.
- Place all global variables in `css/main.css`.

## Git / Workflows
- Keep commit messages concise and in the imperative mood.

## Testing & Quality
- Focus on making interactive elements responsive and accessible.
